#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SD0008 expect=noViolation domain=AE
#note "Every populated AEDECOD is a Preferred Term of the (dummy) MedDRA dictionary; the sheet says Case-insensitive, so the lower-case 'nausea' passes too; the empty AEDECOD on row 3 is a completeness concern for another rule, not a dictionary-membership failure."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#dictionaries dummy
dataset AE class=EVENTS
col USUBJID type=Char
col AEDECOD type=Char
---
001 | Headache
001 | nausea
002 |
